# Project Rules & Context Guidance

This project follows structured Context Engineering principles.

## Reference Links
- Canonical Rules: [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md)
- Context Router: [contextrc.json](../../contextrc.json)
- Architecture Docs: [context/architecture/](../../context/architecture/)
- Coding Guidelines: [context/guidelines/](../../context/guidelines/)

## Core Guidelines
- **Security**: Never log, leak, or create mock versions of sensitive secrets, keys, or private customer data.
- **Anti-Duplication**: Review existing code before authoring new functions or components. Reuse existing patterns.
- **Verification**: Always run or advise running relevant tests and linters after introducing code modifications.
- **Transient Files**: Keep temporary scratch work in `.ai/`, which is ignored by version control.
